rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-SESSION.md:441:`/app/group-monitor` now opens a native monitor session, including the production ALTCHA challenge and attached profile choices. Its group/profile routes use native `AuthToken` requests for snapshots, Booklet XML, profiles, commands and selected unlocks. Signed-int64 JSON IDs stay exact strings in the view and are serialized as numeric tokens for native selection bodies. Dotted group/profile IDs also resolve to the production browser entry on reload.
